<Slide style={{
    width: '1280px',
    height: '720px',
    position: 'relative',
    background: '#0B3D2E',
    padding: 0,
    fontFamily: '"PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif',
}}>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: '640px', height: '720px' }}>
        <Image src="assets/chapter_2.png" style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%', objectFit: 'cover' }} />
        <Box style={{
            position: 'absolute',
            top: 0, left: 0,
            width: '100%', height: '100%',
            background: 'linear-gradient(270deg, #0B3D2E 0%, rgba(11,61,46,.58) 34%, rgba(11,61,46,.14) 66%, rgba(11,61,46,.30) 100%)',
        }} />
        <Box style={{
            position: 'absolute',
            bottom: 56, left: 56,
            flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8,
        }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#F0A050', letterSpacing: 3, fontWeight: 600 }}>
                BEFORE THE MEETING
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: 'rgba(247,243,234,.86)', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                開會前一定要白紙黑字寫下三件事
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{
        position: 'absolute',
        top: 0, right: 0,
        width: '700px', height: '720px',
        padding: '84px 72px 68px 56px',
        flexDirection: 'column',
        justifyContent: 'space-between',
    }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 3, background: '#C75B12' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: 'rgba(247,243,234,.62)', letterSpacing: 3 }}>
                CHAPTER
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 20, alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
            <Text style={{
                fontSize: 96,
                fontWeight: 'bold',
                color: '#C75B12',
                lineHeight: 0.98,
                fontFamily: 'Georgia, "Songti SC", serif',
            }}>
                02
            </Text>
            <Text style={{
                fontSize: 52,
                fontWeight: 'bold',
                color: '#F7F3EA',
                lineHeight: 1.26,
                letterSpacing: 2,
                textAlign: 'right',
                fontFamily: 'Georgia, "Songti SC", "STSong", serif',
            }}>
                主持人的角色
                <br />
                與節奏
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-end', maxWidth: 440 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 88, height: 2, background: 'rgba(240,160,80,.5)' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: 'rgba(247,243,234,.80)', lineHeight: 1.72, textAlign: 'right' }}>
                主持人的價值不在現場的表現力，而在一場會結束之後，留不下來的那幾行白紙黑字。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
